OL,3,GNEWSASix engines called to barn fire at
OL,4,Afamily park
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters are attending a blaze at a
OL,7,Fbarn at a popular family attraction in
OL,8,FSurrey.
OL,10,FSix fire engines are currently at
OL,11,FChobham Adventure Farm near Woking,
OL,12,Faccording to Surrey Fire and Rescue
OL,13,FService.
OL,15,FResidents living nearby are advised to
OL,16,Fkeep doors and windows closed due to
OL,17,Fsmoke.
